# App-authored transition, not from a tape. No tape or manual in the library
# reaches Focus 18. The public description and unverified secondary overview
# associate the destination with unconditional love energy; this body names
# that proposition without prescribing a sensation during the transition.

@segment    climb-f15-f18
@title      Climb — Focus 15 to Focus 18
@levels     F18
@from       F15
@fixed
@verbosity  3
@protected  Focus 18
@duration   ~1m10s

say From Focus 15, you will move through the count to Focus 18.
pause 4
say The available secondary map associates Focus 18 with unconditional love energy. No tape or manual here establishes what the transition should feel like.
pause 6
say Let the numbers mark the change. Observe the transition itself without trying to produce the description in advance.
pause 5
level F18
say Fifteen.
pause 5
say Sixteen.
pause 5
say Seventeen.
pause 5
say Eighteen.
pause 8
